{"id":"b5e1cb8b015b6e17162a3efb9fc43dc6bf454612","axis":"silent","repo":"huggingface/transformers","sha":"b5e1cb8b015b6e17162a3efb9fc43dc6bf454612","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"docs/source/en/_toctree.yml","lines":["@@ -1463,6 +1463,8 @@","         title: MiniCPM-V","       - local: model_doc/minicpmv4_7","         title: MiniCPM-V 4.7","+      - local: model_doc/mistral_large4","+        title: Mistral Large 4","       - local: model_doc/mistral3","         title: Mistral3","       - local: model_doc/mistral4"],"additions":2,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"docs/source/en/model_doc/mistral_large4.md","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,157 @@","+<!--Copyright 2026 the HuggingFace Team. All rights reserved.","+","+Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (the \"License\");","+you may not use this file except in compliance with the License.","+You may obtain a copy of the License at","+","+    http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0","+","+Unless required by applicable law or agreed to in writing, software","+distributed under the License is distributed on an \"AS IS\" BASIS,","+WITHOUT WARRANTIES OR CONDITIONS OF ANY KIND, either express or implied.","+See the License for the specific language governing permissions and","+limitations under the License.","+","+⚠️ Note that this file is in Markdown but contains specific syntax for our doc-builder (similar to MDX) that may not be rendered properly in your Markdown viewer.","+","+-->","+*This model was contributed to Hugging Face Transformers on 2026-10-29.*","+","+<div style=\"float: right;\">","+    <div class=\"flex flex-wrap space-x-1\">","+        <img alt=\"SDPA\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/SDPA-DE3412?style=flat&logo=pytorch&logoColor=white\">","+    </div>","+</div>","+","+# Mistral Large 4","+","+## Overview","+","+Mistral Large 4 is a natively multimodal mixture-of-experts model with 1 trillion parameters and 49 billion active","+parameters per token (52 billion including the embeddings and the output layer). It takes text and images as input,","+produces text, and can answer directly or reason first, with the reasoning effort set per request.","+","+The text decoder builds on the DeepSeek-V3.2 recipe (Multi-head Latent Attention made sparse by a DSA indexer) and adds","+a few changes of its own:","+","+- **Attention**: 72 layers of Deepseek Sparse Attention (DSA) with a 512-dimensional KV latent, made sparse by an","+  indexer selecting the top 2048 key positions for each query. Queries use a direct projection, there is no Q-LoRA.","+  Some layers compute their own selection, the others reuse the one of a previous layer (`\"shared\"`) like in ","+  [GLM-5](./glm_moe_dsa).","+- **NoPE layers**: every 4th layer uses no rotary embedding, in the attention and in the indexer.","+- **KV sharing**: from layer 39 and on, every 4th layer does not compute a KV latent, instead attending to the one of","+  layer 35. They keep their own query, KV up-projection and output weights.","+- **Scaled softmax**: queries are scaled per head by `s * log(position + 1) + b`, with learned `s` and `b`, in the","+  attention and in the indexer.","+- **LeRoPE**: YaRN extends the 512-token base RoPE by a factor of 2048 (1,048,576 positions), and LeRoPE adds a","+  learned multiplier per rotary frequency.","+- **MoE**: the first layer is dense, every other layer routes each token to 4 of 128 experts, plus one shared expert.","+- **Logits**: final logits are soft-capped with `30 * tanh(logits / 30)`.","+","+The vision encoder and the multimodal projector are the same as in [Mistral 3](./mistral3) (Pixtral encoder with a","+patch-merge projector).","+","+## Usage examples","+","+The checkpoint is stored in FP8 (128x128 block-scaled weights with dynamic activation scales) and is loaded as is.","+The full model needs about 1 TB of GPU memory, so `device_map=\"auto\"` is used to spread it across several GPUs.","+","+The chat template accepts a `reasoning_effort` argument, set to `\"none\"` (default) or `\"high\"`. With `\"high\"`, the model","+writes its reasoning between `[THINK]` and `[/THINK]` before answering.","+","+<hfoptions id=\"usage\">","+<hfoption id=\"Image and text\">","+","+```python","+from transformers import AutoProcessor, MistralLarge4ForConditionalGeneration","+","+model_id = \"mistralai/Mistral-Large-4-1T-A52B\"","+","+processor = AutoProcessor.from_pretrained(model_id)","+model = MistralLarge4ForConditionalGeneration.from_pretrained(model_id, device_map=\"auto\")","+","+messages = [","+    {","+        \"role\": \"user\",","+        \"content\": [","+            {\"type\": \"image\", \"url\": \"https://huggingface.co/datasets/huggingface/documentation-images/resolve/main/bee.jpg\"},","+            {\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Describe this image.\"},","+        ],","+    },","+]","+","+inputs = processor.apply_chat_template(","+    messages, add_generation_prompt=True, tokenize=True, return_dict=True, return_tensors=\"pt\"","+).to(model.device)","+","+output = model.generate(**inputs, max_new_tokens=256)","+print(processor.decode(output[0, inputs[\"input_ids\"].shape[1] :], skip_special_tokens=True))","+```","+","+</hfoption>","+<hfoption id=\"Reasoning\">","+","+```python","+from transformers import AutoProcessor, MistralLarge4ForConditionalGeneration","+","+model_id = \"mistralai/Mistral-Large-4-1T-A52B\"","+","+processor = AutoProcessor.from_pretrained(model_id)","+model = MistralLarge4ForConditionalGeneration.from_pretrained(model_id, device_map=\"auto\")","+","+messages = [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"How many prime numbers are there between 100 and 150?\"}]","+","+inputs = processor.apply_chat_template(","+    messages,","+    add_generation_prompt=True,","+    tokenize=True,","+    return_dict=True,","+    return_tensors=\"pt\",","+    reasoning_effort=\"high\",","+).to(model.device)","+","+output = model.generate(**inputs, max_new_tokens=4096)","+# Keep the special tokens to see the reasoning between [THINK] and [/THINK]","+print(processor.decode(output[0, inputs[\"input_ids\"].shape[1] :], skip_special_tokens=False))","+```","+","+</hfoption>","+</hfoptions>","+","+## Notes","+","+- The checkpoint also contains a draft head for speculative decoding (the `mtp_dspark.*` weights) using the DSpark","+    speculative decoding method. <!-- TODO: implement DSpark or specify this is not supported -->","+- The DSA indexer is applied as an attention mask on top of dense attention, with the `eager` and `sdpa` backends.","+  It gives the same outputs as sparse attention but not its speed-up on long sequences.","+<!-- ","+TODO: ask tokenizer people about this","+- The tokenizer reads a literal `[INST]` typed in a user message as the control token, while the reference","+  [mistral-common](https://github.com/mistralai/mistral-common) tokenizer keeps it as plain text. -->","+","+## MistralLarge4Config","+","+[[autodoc]] MistralLarge4Config","+","+## MistralLarge4TextConfig","+","+[[autodoc]] MistralLarge4TextConfig","+","+## MistralLarge4PreTrainedModel","+","+[[autodoc]] MistralLarge4PreTrainedModel","+","+## MistralLarge4TextModel","+","+[[autodoc]] MistralLarge4TextModel","+    - forward","+","+## MistralLarge4Model","+","+[[autodoc]] MistralLarge4Model","+    - forward","+","+## MistralLarge4ForConditionalGeneration","+","+[[autodoc]] MistralLarge4ForConditionalGeneration","+    - forward"],"additions":157,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/transformers/conversion_mapping.py","lines":["@@ -2318,6 +2318,71 @@ def _build_checkpoint_conversion_mapping():","         ),","     ]"," ","+    mapping[\"mistral_large4\"] = [","+        # Dispatch the root vision_encoder to the vision model","+        WeightRenaming(r\"^vision_encoder\\.\", \"model.vision_tower.\"),","+        # Dispatch the root language modules to the language model","+        WeightRenaming(r\"^tok_embeddings\\.\", \"model.language_model.embed_tokens.\"),","+        WeightRenaming(r\"^lerope\\.alpha\", \"model.language_model.rotary_emb.alpha\"),","+        WeightRenaming(r\"^layers\\.\", \"model.language_model.layers.\"),","+        WeightRenaming(r\"^norm\\.\", \"model.language_model.norm.\"),","+        # And the rest to the multi-modal projector","+        WeightRenaming(r\"^output\\.\", \"lm_head.\"),","+        WeightRenaming(r\"^pre_mm_projector_norm\\.\", \"model.multi_modal_projector.norm.\"),","+        WeightRenaming(r\"^patch_merger\\.\", \"model.multi_modal_projector.patch_merger.\"),","+        WeightRenaming(r\"^vision_language_adapter\\.w_in\\.\", \"model.multi_modal_projector.linear_1.\"),","+        WeightRenaming(r\"^vision_language_adapter\\.w_out\\.\", \"model.multi_modal_projector.linear_2.\"),","+        # Rename the attention projections shared by both towers: value and output","+        WeightRenaming(r\"\\.wv\\.\", \".v_proj.\"),","+        WeightRenaming(r\"\\.wo\\.\", \".o_proj.\"),","+        # Same for up, down and gate projection weights (except for routed experts' which will be handled by converters)","+        WeightRenaming(r\"\\.(feed_forward|shared_experts)\\.w1\\.\", r\".\\1.gate_proj.\"),","+        WeightRenaming(r\"\\.(feed_forward|shared_experts)\\.w2\\.\", r\".\\1.down_proj.\"),","+        WeightRenaming(r\"\\.(feed_forward|shared_experts)\\.w3\\.\", r\".\\1.up_proj.\"),","+        # Vision model Q and K projectors: saved for interleaved RoPE, Pixtral expects rotate-half","+        WeightConverter(","+            source_patterns=r\"attention\\.wq\\.\",","+            target_patterns=\"attention.q_proj.\",","+            operations=[PermuteForRope(subconfig_key=\"vision_config\")],","+        ),","+        WeightConverter(","+            source_patterns=r\"attention\\.wk\\.\",","+            target_patterns=\"attention.k_proj.\",","+            operations=[PermuteForRope(subconfig_key=\"vision_config\")],","+        ),","+    ]","+    mapping[\"mistral_large4_text\"] = [","+        # Rename attention modules (the indexer keeps wk, wq_b, and weights_proj)","+        WeightRenaming(r\"\\.attention\\.\", r\"\\.self_attn\\.\"),","+        WeightRenaming(r\"\\.wq\\.\", \".q_proj.\"),","+        WeightRenaming(r\"\\.wkv_a_with_mqa\\.\", r\"\\.kv_a_proj_with_mqa\\.\"),","+        WeightRenaming(r\"\\.wkv_b\\.\", \".kv_b_proj.\"),","+        # Rename the norms","+        WeightRenaming(r\"\\.attention_norm\\.\", r\"\\.input_layernorm\\.\"),","+        WeightRenaming(r\"\\.ffn_norm\\.\", r\"\\.post_attention_layernorm\\.\"),","+        WeightRenaming(r\"\\.kv_a_norm\\.\", r\"\\.kv_a_layernorm\\.\"),","+        # Rename MLPs and MoEs to the \"mlp\" prefix","+        WeightRenaming(r\"\\.feed_forward\\.\", r\"\\.mlp\\.\"),","+        WeightRenaming(r\"\\.gate\\.\", r\"\\.mlp.gate\\.\"),","+        WeightRenaming(r\"\\.experts\\.\", r\"\\.mlp.experts\\.\"),","+        WeightRenaming(r\"\\.shared_experts\\.\", r\"\\.mlp.shared_experts\\.\"),","+        # Rename softmax scaling module","+        WeightRenaming(r\"\\.ssmax_scaling.s\", r\"\\.softmax_scaling.scale\"),","+        WeightRenaming(r\"\\.ssmax_scaling.b\", r\"\\.softmax_scaling.bias\"),","+        # Concatenate w1 (gate) and w3 (up) weights into a single weight and merge across experts","+        WeightConverter(","+            source_patterns=[r\"\\.experts.*.w1.weight\", r\"\\.experts.*.w3.weight\"],","+            target_patterns=r\"\\.experts.gate_up_proj\",","+            operations=[MergeModulelist(dim=0), Concatenate(dim=1)],","+        ),","+        # Merge w2 (down) weights across experts","+        WeightConverter(","+            source_patterns=r\"\\.experts.*.w2.weight\",","+            target_patterns=r\"\\.experts.down_proj\",","+            operations=[MergeModulelist(dim=0)],","+        ),","+    ]","+","     for model_type, base_pattern in _MODEL_TO_CONVERSION_PATTERN.items():","         if model_type in mapping:","             continue"],"additions":65,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/transformers/models/__init__.py","lines":["@@ -308,6 +308,7 @@","     from .mistral import *","     from .mistral3 import *","     from .mistral4 import *","+    from .mistral_large4 import *","     from .mixtral import *","     from .mlcd import *","     from .mllama import *"],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/transformers/models/auto/auto_mappings.py","lines":["@@ -423,6 +423,8 @@","         (\"mistral\", \"MistralConfig\"),","         (\"mistral3\", \"Mistral3Config\"),","         (\"mistral4\", \"Mistral4Config\"),","+        (\"mistral_large4\", \"MistralLarge4Config\"),","+        (\"mistral_large4_text\", \"MistralLarge4TextConfig\"),","         (\"mixtral\", \"MixtralConfig\"),","         (\"mlcd_vision_model\", \"MLCDVisionConfig\"),","         (\"mllama\", \"MllamaConfig\"),","@@ -948,6 +950,7 @@","         (\"minicpmv4_7_vision\", \"minicpmv4_7\"),","         (\"minimax_m3_vl_text\", \"minimax_m3_vl\"),","         (\"minimax_m3_vl_vision\", \"minimax_m3_vl\"),","+        (\"mistral_large4_text\", \"mistral_large4\"),","         (\"mlcd_vision_model\", \"mlcd\"),","         (\"mllama_text_model\", \"mllama\"),","         (\"mllama_vision_model\", \"mllama\"),"],"additions":3,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/transformers/models/auto/image_processing_auto.py","lines":["@@ -118,6 +118,7 @@","             (\"mgp-str\", {\"torchvision\": \"ViTImageProcessor\", \"pil\": \"ViTImageProcessorPil\"}),","             (\"minicpmv4_7\", {\"pil\": \"MiniCPMV4_6ImageProcessorPil\", \"torchvision\": \"MiniCPMV4_6ImageProcessor\"}),","             (\"mistral3\", {\"torchvision\": \"PixtralImageProcessor\", \"pil\": \"PixtralImageProcessorPil\"}),","+            (\"mistral_large4\", {\"torchvision\": \"PixtralImageProcessor\", \"pil\": \"PixtralImageProcessorPil\"}),","             (\"mlcd\", {\"torchvision\": \"CLIPImageProcessor\", \"pil\": \"CLIPImageProcessorPil\"}),","             (","                 \"mm-grounding-dino\","],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/transformers/models/auto/modeling_auto.py","lines":["@@ -356,6 +356,8 @@ class _BaseModelWithGenerate(PreTrainedModel, GenerationMixin):","         (\"mistral\", \"MistralModel\"),","         (\"mistral3\", \"Mistral3Model\"),","         (\"mistral4\", \"Mistral4Model\"),","+        (\"mistral_large4\", \"MistralLarge4Model\"),","+        (\"mistral_large4_text\", \"MistralLarge4TextModel\"),","         (\"mixtral\", \"MixtralModel\"),","         (\"mlcd\", \"MLCDVisionModel\"),  # Keep this to make some original hub repositories (from `DeepGlint-AI`) works","         (\"mlcd_vision_model\", \"MLCDVisionModel\"),","@@ -693,6 +695,7 @@ class _BaseModelWithGenerate(PreTrainedModel, GenerationMixin):","         (\"megatron-bert\", \"MegatronBertForPreTraining\"),","         (\"mistral3\", \"Mistral3ForConditionalGeneration\"),","         (\"mistral4\", \"Mistral4ForCausalLM\"),","+        (\"mistral_large4\", \"MistralLarge4ForConditionalGeneration\"),","         (\"mllama\", \"MllamaForConditionalGeneration\"),","         (\"mobilebert\", \"MobileBertForPreTraining\"),","         (\"moss_transcribe_diarize\", \"MossTranscribeDiarizeForConditionalGeneration\"),","@@ -1196,6 +1199,7 @@ class _BaseModelWithGenerate(PreTrainedModel, GenerationMixin):","         (\"minimax_m3_vl\", \"MiniMaxM3SparseForConditionalGeneration\"),","         (\"mistral3\", \"Mistral3ForConditionalGeneration\"),","         (\"mistral4\", \"Mistral4ForCausalLM\"),","+        (\"mistral_large4\", \"MistralLarge4ForConditionalGeneration\"),","         (\"mllama\", \"MllamaForConditionalGeneration\"),","         (\"molmo2\", \"Molmo2ForConditionalGeneration\"),","         (\"muse_glimmer\", \"MuseGlimmerForConditionalGeneration\"),"],"additions":4,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/transformers/models/auto/processing_auto.py","lines":["@@ -70,6 +70,7 @@","             (\"lasr_encoder\", \"LasrProcessor\"),","             (\"metaclip_2\", \"CLIPProcessor\"),","             (\"mistral3\", \"PixtralProcessor\"),","+            (\"mistral_large4\", \"PixtralProcessor\"),","             (\"mm-grounding-dino\", \"GroundingDinoProcessor\"),","             (\"modernvbert\", \"Idefics3Processor\"),","             (\"moonshine\", \"Wav2Vec2Processor\"),"],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/transformers/models/auto/tokenization_auto.py","lines":["@@ -229,6 +229,12 @@","             if is_mistral_common_available()","             else (\"TokenizersBackend\" if is_tokenizers_available() else None),","         ),","+        (","+            \"mistral_large4\",","+            \"MistralCommonBackend\"","+            if is_mistral_common_available()","+            else (\"TokenizersBackend\" if is_tokenizers_available() else None),","+        ),  # TODO: needed?","         (","             \"mixtral\",","             \"MistralCommonBackend\""],"additions":6,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/transformers/models/mistral_large4/__init__.py","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,33 @@","+#                🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨","+#           This file was automatically generated from the modules in `src/transformers/models/mistral_large4`.","+#           Do NOT edit this file manually as any edits will be overwritten by auto-generation of the file.","+#                       A module is picked up once it exports a name through `__all__`.","+#                   Regenerate the file with: `python utils/check_inits.py --fix_and_overwrite`","+#                🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨","+# Copyright 2026 the HuggingFace Team. All rights reserved.","+#","+# Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (the \"License\");","+# you may not use this file except in compliance with the License.","+# You may obtain a copy of the License at","+#","+#     http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0","+#","+# Unless required by applicable law or agreed to in writing, software","+# distributed under the License is distributed on an \"AS IS\" BASIS,","+# WITHOUT WARRANTIES OR CONDITIONS OF ANY KIND, either express or implied.","+# See the License for the specific language governing permissions and","+# limitations under the License.","+from typing import TYPE_CHECKING","+","+from ...utils import _LazyModule","+from ...utils.import_utils import define_import_structure","+","+","+if TYPE_CHECKING:","+    from .configuration_mistral_large4 import *","+    from .modeling_mistral_large4 import *","+else:","+    import sys","+","+    _file = globals()[\"__file__\"]","+    sys.modules[__name__] = _LazyModule(__name__, _file, define_import_structure(_file), module_spec=__spec__)"],"additions":33,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/transformers/models/mistral_large4/configuration_mistral_large4.py","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,264 @@","+#                🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨","+#           This file was automatically generated from src/transformers/models/mistral_large4/modular_mistral_large4.py.","+#               Do NOT edit this file manually as any edits will be overwritten by the generation of","+#             the file from the modular. If any change should be done, please apply the change to the","+#                          modular_mistral_large4.py file directly. One of our CI enforces this.","+#                🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨","+# Copyright 2026 HuggingFace Inc. team. All rights reserved.","+#","+#","+# Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (the \"License\");","+# you may not use this file except in compliance with the License.","+# You may obtain a copy of the License at","+#","+#     http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0","+#","+# Unless required by applicable law or agreed to in writing, software","+# distributed under the License is distributed on an \"AS IS\" BASIS,","+# WITHOUT WARRANTIES OR CONDITIONS OF ANY KIND, either express or implied.","+# See the License for the specific language governing permissions and","+# limitations under the License.","+","+from huggingface_hub.dataclasses import strict","+","+from ...configuration_utils import PreTrainedConfig, SubConfigSpec","+from ...utils import auto_docstring","+from ..auto import AutoConfig","+","+","+@auto_docstring(checkpoint=\"zai-org/GLM-5\")","+@strict","+class MistralLarge4TextConfig(PreTrainedConfig):","+    r\"\"\"","+    n_group (`int`, *optional*, defaults to 1):","+        Number of groups for routed experts.","+    mlp_layer_types (`list`, *optional*):","+        MLP type pattern for each layer (`\"dense\"` or `\"sparse\"`). Defaults to 1 dense + rest sparse.","+    index_topk (`int`, *optional*, defaults to 2048):","+        Number of top tokens selected by the indexer for sparse attention.","+    index_head_dim (`int`, *optional*, defaults to 128):","+        Head dimension for the indexer projections (DSA).","+    index_n_heads (`int`, *optional*, defaults to 32):","+        Number of heads for the indexer projections (DSA).","+    first_k_dense_replace (`int`, *optional*, defaults to 1):","+        Number of leading layers that use a dense MLP; the rest use the MoE block.","+    indexer_types (`list[str]`, *optional*):","+        Per-layer indexer mode (`\"full\"` runs the indexer, `\"shared\"` reuses the previous full","+        layer's top-k). Defaults to the pattern derived from `index_topk_freq` /","+        `index_skip_topk_offset` (or `index_topk_pattern`).","+    no_rope_layers (`list[int]`, *optional*):","+        List with at least the same length as the number of layers in the model.","+        A `1` at an index position indicates that the corresponding layer will use RoPE,","+        while a `0` indicates that it's a NoPE layer.","+    no_rope_layer_interval (`int`, *optional*, defaults to 4):","+        Every `no_rope_layer_interval`-th layer is a NoPE layer (no rotary embedding in the attention nor in the","+        indexer). The other layers use RoPE.","+    kv_source_layers (`list[int]`, *optional*):","+        For each layer, the index of the layer whose latent KV cache it attends to. A layer whose entry is its own","+        index computes and caches its own latent KV; a layer pointing at an earlier layer has no `kv_a_proj_with_mqa`","+        and reuses that layer's cache (the source layer must be its own source). Defaults to no sharing.","+","+    ```python","+    >>> from transformers import MistralLarge4TextConfig, MistralLarge4TextModel","+","+    >>> # Initializing a Mistral Large 4 text configuration","+    >>> configuration = MistralLarge4TextConfig()","+","+    >>> # Initializing a model from the configuration","+    >>> model = MistralLarge4TextModel(configuration)","+","+    >>> # Accessing the model configuration","+    >>> configuration = model.config","+    ```\"\"\"","+","+    model_type = \"mistral_large4_text\"","+    keys_to_ignore_at_inference = [\"past_key_values\"]","+","+    base_model_tp_plan = {","+        \"layers.*.mlp.experts.gate_up_proj\": \"packed_colwise\",","+        \"layers.*.mlp.experts.down_proj\": \"rowwise\",","+        \"layers.*.mlp.experts\": \"moe_tp_experts\",","+        \"layers.*.mlp.shared_experts.gate_proj\": \"colwise\",","+        \"layers.*.mlp.shared_experts.up_proj\": \"colwise\",","+        \"layers.*.mlp.shared_experts.down_proj\": \"rowwise\",","+        \"layers.*.mlp.gate_proj\": \"colwise\",","+        \"layers.*.mlp.up_proj\": \"colwise\",","+        \"layers.*.mlp.down_proj\": \"rowwise\",","+    }","+    base_model_pp_plan = {","+        \"embed_tokens\": ([\"input_ids\"], [\"inputs_embeds\"]),","+        \"layers\": ([\"hidden_states\", \"attention_mask\"], [\"hidden_states\"]),","+        \"norm\": ([\"hidden_states\"], [\"hidden_states\"]),","+    }","+    base_model_ep_plan = {","+        \"layers.*.mlp.experts.gate_up_proj\": \"grouped_gemm\",","+        \"layers.*.mlp.experts.down_proj\": \"grouped_gemm\",","+        \"layers.*.mlp.experts\": \"ep_dispatch_experts\",","+    }","+","+    attribute_map = {\"num_local_experts\": \"n_routed_experts\"}","+","+    vocab_size: int = 204800","+    hidden_size: int = 6144","+    intermediate_size: int = 24576","+    moe_intermediate_size: int = 6144","+    num_hidden_layers: int = 72","+    num_attention_heads: int = 64","+    num_key_value_heads: int = 64","+    n_shared_experts: int = 1","+    n_routed_experts: int = 128","+    output_router_logits: bool = False","+    routed_scaling_factor: float = 1.0","+    kv_lora_rank: int = 512","+    qk_rope_head_dim: int = 64","+    v_head_dim: int = 128","+    qk_nope_head_dim: int = 64","+    n_group: int = 1","+    topk_group: int = 1","+    num_experts_per_tok: int = 4","+    hidden_act: str = \"silu\"","+    max_position_embeddings: int = 1048576","+    initializer_range: float = 0.02","+    rms_norm_eps: float = 1e-5","+    use_cache: bool = True","+    pad_token_id: int | None = None","+    bos_token_id: int | None = 1","+    eos_token_id: int | list[int] | None = 2","+    tie_word_embeddings: bool = False","+    rope_parameters: dict | None = None","+    mlp_layer_types: list[str] | None = None","+    attention_bias: bool = False","+    attention_dropout: float | int = 0.0","+    index_topk: int = 2048","+    index_head_dim: int = 128","+    index_n_heads: int = 32","+    head_dim: int = 64","+    first_k_dense_replace: int = 1","+    layer_types: list[str] | None = None","+    # `\"full\"` runs the indexer, `\"shared\"` reuses the previous full layer's index mask.","+    indexer_types: list[str] | None = None","+    no_rope_layers: list[int] | None = None","+    no_rope_layer_interval: int = 4","+    kv_source_layers: list[int] | None = None","+    final_logit_softcapping: float = 30.0","+","+    def __post_init__(self, **kwargs):","+        # YaRN over a 512-token pretraining window, no magnitude scaling (attention_factor = 1.0) + LeRoPE","+        if self.rope_parameters is None:","+            self.rope_parameters = {","+                \"rope_type\": \"yarn\",","+                \"rope_theta\": 10000.0,","+                \"factor\": 2048.0,","+                \"original_max_position_embeddings\": 512,","+                \"beta_fast\": 32.0,","+                \"beta_slow\": 1.0,","+                \"attention_factor\": 1.0,","+            }","+        # NoPE every `no_rope_layer_interval`-th layer (smollm3 convention: 1 == uses RoPE)","+        if self.no_rope_layers is None:","+            self.no_rope_layers = [","+                int((layer_idx + 1) % self.no_rope_layer_interval != 0) for layer_idx in range(self.num_hidden_layers)","+            ]","+        # KV sharing: by default every layer owns its latent KV cache","+        if self.kv_source_layers is None:","+            self.kv_source_layers = list(range(self.num_hidden_layers))","+        # Per-layer indexer mode: a pattern (e.g. `\"FSSF...\"`) overrides the freq/offset schedule.","+        if self.indexer_types is None:","+            pattern = kwargs.get(\"index_topk_pattern\")","+            if pattern is not None:","+                self.indexer_types = (","+                    [{\"F\": \"full\", \"S\": \"shared\"}[c] for c in pattern] if isinstance(pattern, str) else list(pattern)","+                )","+            else:","+                freq = max(kwargs.get(\"index_topk_freq\", 1), 1)","+                offset = kwargs.get(\"index_skip_topk_offset\", 2)","+                self.indexer_types = [","+                    \"full\" if (max(i - offset + 1, 0) % freq) == 0 else \"shared\" for i in range(self.num_hidden_layers)","+                ]","+        self.qk_head_dim = self.qk_nope_head_dim + self.qk_rope_head_dim","+        # RoPE applies only to the rope slice, so point `head_dim` at it: the inherited (Llama) rotary","+        # embedding reads `config.head_dim` and then computes the right frequencies with no override needed.","+        self.head_dim = self.qk_rope_head_dim","+        # MLP layer types: the first `first_k_dense_replace` layers are dense, the rest are MoE.","+        if self.mlp_layer_types is None:","+            n_dense = min(self.first_k_dense_replace, self.num_hidden_layers)","+            self.mlp_layer_types = [\"dense\"] * n_dense + [\"sparse\"] * (self.num_hidden_layers - n_dense)","+        # Every layer is DSA — drives cache-class dispatch.","+        if self.layer_types is None:","+            self.layer_types = [\"indexed_attention\"] * self.num_hidden_layers","+        # BC: re-route `num_experts` to `n_routed_experts`","+        if (num_experts := kwargs.get(\"num_experts\")) is not None:","+            self.n_routed_experts = num_experts","+        super().__post_init__(**kwargs)","+","+    def validate_architecture(self):","+        # Validate KV sharing patterns","+        if len(self.kv_source_layers) != self.num_hidden_layers:","+            raise ValueError(","+                f\"`kv_source_layers` must have one entry per layer ({self.num_hidden_layers}), got {len(self.kv_source_layers)}.\"","+            )","+        for layer_idx, source in enumerate(self.kv_source_layers):","+            if source > layer_idx or self.kv_source_layers[source] != source:","+                raise ValueError(","+                    f\"Layer {layer_idx} must share KV with an earlier layer that owns its cache, got {source}.\"","+                )","+        super().validate_architecture()","+","+","+@auto_docstring(checkpoint=\"mistralai/Mistral-Small-3.1-24B-Instruct-2503\")","+@strict","+class MistralLarge4Config(PreTrainedConfig):","+    r\"\"\"","+    Example:","+","+    ```python","+    >>> from transformers import MistralLarge4ForConditionalGeneration, MistralLarge4Config, PixtralVisionConfig, MistralConfig","+","+    >>> # Initializing a Pixtral-vision config","+    >>> vision_config = PixtralVisionConfig()","+","+    >>> # Initializing a Mistral config","+    >>> text_config = MistralConfig()","+","+    >>> # Initializing a MistralLarge4 configuration","+    >>> configuration = MistralLarge4Config(vision_config, text_config)","+","+    >>> # Initializing a model from the mistral_large4.1 configuration","+    >>> model = MistralLarge4ForConditionalGeneration(configuration)","+","+    >>> # Accessing the model configuration","+    >>> configuration = model.config","+    ```\"\"\"","+","+    model_type = \"mistral_large4\"","+    attribute_map = {\"image_token_id\": \"image_token_index\"}","+    sub_configs_defaults = {","+        \"text_config\": MistralLarge4TextConfig,","+        # Mistral Large 4 vision tower (same as Mistral Small 3.1: gated SiLU MLP, 1540 px images)","+        \"vision_config\": SubConfigSpec(","+            config_class=AutoConfig,","+            model_type=\"pixtral\",","+            init_kwargs={","+                \"hidden_size\": 2048,","+                \"intermediate_size\": 6144,","+                \"num_hidden_layers\": 30,","+                \"num_attention_heads\": 16,","+                \"patch_size\": 14,","+                \"image_size\": 1540,","+                \"hidden_act\": \"silu\",","+            },","+        ),","+    }","+","+    vision_config: dict | PreTrainedConfig | None = None","+    text_config: dict | PreTrainedConfig | None = None","+    image_token_index: int = 10","+    projector_hidden_act: str = \"gelu\"","+    vision_feature_layer: int | list[int] = -1","+    multimodal_projector_bias: bool = False","+    spatial_merge_size: int = 2","+","+    tie_word_embeddings: bool = False","+","+","+__all__ = [\"MistralLarge4TextConfig\", \"MistralLarge4Config\"]"],"additions":264,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/transformers/models/mistral_large4/convert_mistral_large4_to_hf.py","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,259 @@","+import argparse","+import json","+import os","+from copy import deepcopy","+from pathlib import Path","+from typing import Any","+","+from transformers import PixtralImageProcessor, PixtralProcessor","+from transformers.integrations.m